                    <span class="" style="font-size:4em;font-weight:bold;color:#fff;">&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
                    <p class="quote">He who does not show mercy to the people, Allah also does not show mercy to him.</p>
                    <p class="">Hadith | Sahih Bukhari</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            @* End Qoute Section 2 *@
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
    </div>
